@startuml Sequence Diagram - Delete Document

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "KnowledgeDocumentView" as DocView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> DocView : 1 Open documents list page
activate DocView
DocView -> DocView : 2 Display documents list

Admin -> DocView : 3 Select document to delete
Admin -> DocView : 4 Click "Delete" button

DocView -> DocView : 5 Confirm deletion action

DocView -> ClerkAuth : 6 Send delete request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 7 Delete document
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 8 Remove document record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 9 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> DocView : 10 Success notification
DocView -> Admin : 11 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate DocView

@enduml
